---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice for ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}: publisher and hosting`} description="Publisher, publication director, hosting provider, independence from the SSA, limits of liability, intellectual property and governing law for this Social Security calculator." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information published under Article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy, the publisher being established in France.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content of {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Hosting provider</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Independence and no advice</h2>
    <p>This site is independent. It is not run by, affiliated with or endorsed by the Social Security Administration, the Internal Revenue Service, the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services or any other government body. Its calculators give <strong>estimates</strong> from the information you enter and the published 2026 parameters; they are not financial, legal or tax advice, and your benefit is the one the SSA determines from your earnings record. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>method page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>Parameters are re-read on their official sources and the engine is checked by automated tests before every release, without any guarantee that no error remains. The publisher is not liable for a decision taken on the sole basis of an estimate. Report errors through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Texts, graphics and code belong to the publisher; short quotations with a link to the page are welcome. Figures from federal agencies are public-domain works of the United States government.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2><p>The calculator may be embedded free of charge in an iframe, keeping the credit link visible: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>What you type stays in your browser; no cookie is set and the publisher records no personal data, stability being monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reporting content</h2><p>Unlawful content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law. Failing an amicable settlement, the competent courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
